  "Appointments are added, moved, resized, copied and deleted with the pointer, the keys and code; every change asks its event first, can wait for a server, and goes back when saving fails.": "",
  "Drag, resize, edit": "",
  "The box itself goes where the appointment would go while it is dragged, on the step of `snapMinutes`; near the edges the view scrolls. A finger starts a drag with a long press.": "",
  "Saving to a server": "",
  "With a data source the changes go through its adapter. While one saves the appointment stays where it was put and cannot be changed; when it fails `onDataError` tells, and it goes back.": "",
  "The form": "",
  "`onFormOpening` gets the form's `items` (a `FormLayout`) and its `data`: add your own fields, take some away, or cancel and show a form of your own.": "",
  "Rules": "",
  "`onMoving` and `onResizing` say where an appointment may go: cancelled, the drag shows it cannot drop there. An appointment's own `allowDrag` and `allowResize` lock it.": "",
  "The form for a new appointment over the selection.": "",
  "Its form. Space: its tooltip.": "",
  "Move it: Up / Down a step (a week in the month), Left / Right a day. Shift + arrows: its end. Enter saves, Escape takes it back.": "",
  "Deletes the focused appointment (asking first).": "",
  "Drops a copy.": "",
  "Takes it back.": "",
  "`false`: read only. Or each switch: `allowAdding`, `allowUpdating`, `allowDeleting`, `allowDragging`, `allowResizing`, `allowCopying`, `confirmDelete`.": "",
  "the same names": "",
  "An appointment’s own switches; they win over `editing`.": "",
  "the cell": "",
  "The step a drag and the keys move by.": "",
  "The shortest an appointment gets by resizing, in minutes.": "",
  "A click on an appointment shows its tooltip with Edit and Delete.": "",
  "Adds where the appointments come from (pushed into the array, or inserted through the data source); resolves to it.": "",
  "Changes its fields; resolves `false` when an event said no or saving failed.": "",
  "Deletes it (no question programmatically).": "",
  "The form for an appointment, or for a new one at `cell` (the selection by default).": "",
  "Its tooltip.": "",
  "`{ appointment, byUser, cancel, promise? }`: the values may still be changed; `promise` waits (a server).": "",
  "`{ appointment, byUser, cancel, promise? }`, after the question when it asks.": "",
  "`{ appointment, data, items, form, cancel }`: change the fields, or cancel to open your own form.": "",
  "`{ appointment, start, end, allDay, copy, byKeys, cancel }`: cancel on `moving` marks a place it may not go.": "",
  "The same, for the edges.": "",
